  "text": "We’ve chosen our plan. Now let’s make sure our friends know what to expect.\n\nOur guests are on their way. Stay with me while they arrive.\n\nNow the story reaches the loaves she’d been hoping to make.\n\nWhat did Mara tell you about why she stopped visiting?\n\nWhat kept you from bringing your story before today?\n\nWe found a way to share our stories again.\n\nPlease take this copy of my story to Mara.\n\nLet’s continue sharing our stories.\n\n“Bring the same cake,” he said.\n\n“Keep it in your backpack,”\n\n“She wrote me a story?”",
